>> Combination := Jokkalante xees.

Combination bu: ['yokk-ci-mujj:'] def: { :el
	man 
	wone: el, Dara? dëgg: { man yokk-ci-mujj: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination xees.
colours
	yokk-ci-mujj: ['red'],
	yokk-ci-mujj: ['green'],
	yokk-ci-mujj: ['blue'],
	yokk-ci-mujj: ['red'].

Génn bind: colours, taxaw.
